OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1785592073
OL,3,CDriver jailed after car hits and kills
OL,4,Cman carrying him on roof for a mile
OL,6,FA driver who struck a pedestrian,
OL,7,Fcarrying him on the roof of a car for
OL,8,Fa mile, has been jailed for almost 10
OL,9,Fyears.
OL,11,FAlbert Matraxhiu, 29, had pleaded
OL,12,Fguilty to causing death by dangerous
OL,13,Fdriving after fatally colliding with a
OL,14,Fpedestrian on 29 December 2025.
OL,16,FTravelling at 76mph in a 40mph zone,
OL,17,FMatraxhiu hit 89 year old Tom Wallace
OL,18,Fat a crossing on the A289 Gads Hill.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
