OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1785592073
OL,3,CDriver jailed after car hits and kills
OL,4,Cman carrying him on roof for a mile
OL,6,FHe continued with his victim on the
OL,7,Froof for almost a mile to Grange Road
OL,8,Fwhere Mr Wallace fell from the car.
OL,10,FOfficers and paramedics attended but
OL,11,FMr Wallace was declared dead at the
OL,12,Fscene.
OL,14,FMatraxhiu and his passenger, Erald
OL,15,FPaci, abandoned the vehicle on nearby
OL,16,FEastcourt Lane before fleeing the
OL,17,Fscene.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1785592073
OL,3,CDriver jailed after car hits and kills
OL,4,Cman carrying him on roof for a mile
OL,6,FA large-scale operation was launched
OL,7,Fand Paci, 30, handed himself in that
OL,8,Fevening and identified Matraxhiu as
OL,9,Fthe driver of the car.
OL,11,FMatraxhiu also voluntarily attended a
OL,12,Fpolice station the day after the
OL,13,Fcollision.
OL,15,FThe Albanian national was subsequently
OL,16,Fcharged with causing death by
OL,17,Fdangerous driving, failing to stop
OL,18,Fafter a collision, and driving without
OL,19,Fa licence or insurance.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1785592073
OL,3,CDriver jailed after car hits and kills
OL,4,Cman carrying him on roof for a mile
OL,6,FHe was also charged alongside Paci for
OL,7,Fperverting the course of justice by
OL,8,Fremoving and disposing of the car's
OL,9,Fnumber plates, their clothes and their
OL,10,Fphones.
OL,12,FMatraxhiu admitted to all the charges
OL,13,Fat Maidstone Crown Court on 2 February.
OL,15,FAt the same court on Friday 31 July,
OL,16,FMatraxhiu, of Orange Hill Road,
OL,17,FEdgware, was sentenced to 9 years and
OL,18,F10 months in prison.
OL,20,FHe will also be disqualified from
OL,21,Fdriving for 6 years after release.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1785592073
OL,3,CDriver jailed after car hits and kills
OL,4,Cman carrying him on roof for a mile
OL,6,FPaci, of Five Way Court, Chatham,
OL,7,Fpleaded guilty to perverting the
OL,8,Fcourse of justice and was sentenced at
OL,9,Fthe same hearing to 15 months in
OL,10,Fprison but was released after the
OL,11,Fsentencing hearing due to time served
OL,12,Fon remand.
OL,14,FSenior investigating officer Detective
OL,15,FInspector Zoe Wilczek said:
OL,16,F"Matraxhiu's dangerous and amoral
OL,17,Factions have taken a man's life and
OL,18,Fshocked the local community.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1785592073
OL,3,CDriver jailed after car hits and kills
OL,4,Cman carrying him on roof for a mile
OL,6,F'"His deliberate and calculated
OL,7,Fattempts to evade capture and avoid
OL,8,Ffacing the consequences of his actions
OL,9,Fare evidence of his poor substance of
OL,10,Fcharacter and we are satisfied he is
OL,11,Ffacing a long time behind bars.
OL,13,F"Mr Wallace was much-loved and deeply
OL,14,Frespected by his family and the
OL,15,Fcommunity, and we hope today's
OL,16,Fsentence brings a sense of justice to
OL,17,Fall that knew him."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
